/E (The primary application of this system is as an assistive device for visually impaired individuals, helping them detect obstacles and navigate safely. Beyond this, the circuit can be used in basic obstacle detection and avoidance systems where immediate response is required. It is also suitable for simple security and alert systems, where the presence of an object needs to be detected and indicated. Furthermore, this design can serve as a foundational model for small automation projects and can be extended or modified for more advanced systems by integrating additional sensors or control mechanisms.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
